1
00:00:07,993 --> 00:00:09,860
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:10,011 --> 00:00:12,144
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,206 --> 00:00:17,362
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,233 --> 00:00:22,019
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,804 --> 00:00:27,711
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,426
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,682 --> 00:00:34,971
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,093 --> 00:00:39,528
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,497 --> 00:00:44,164
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,859 --> 00:00:48,935
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,302 --> 00:00:52,928
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,731 --> 00:00:58,126
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,204 --> 00:01:01,964
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,464 --> 00:01:08,326
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,165 --> 00:01:15,779
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:18,611
=Episode 25=

17
00:01:49,100 --> 00:01:50,100
(Case Closure Report:
Xincheng Road Traffic Accident)

18
00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:51,072
(Case Closure Report: Murder of Qin Hai)

19
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,719
I'm only here today

20
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,240
because of my brother.

21
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:22,840
Same here.

22
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,599
I found out Fu's death

23
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:30,879
may have something to do with Cheng
and Luo Song.

24
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:35,280
Boss Hai's death may be connected
to them too.

25
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,723
As for how all of this

26
00:02:37,724 --> 00:02:38,800
is connected,

27
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:41,479
I'm still looking into it.

28
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,199
So it really was Luo Song.

29
00:03:07,199 --> 00:03:08,680
Have you figured out how you're
going to investigate this?

30
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,479
I have my own way.

31
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,240
You don't need to worry about it.

32
00:03:16,439 --> 00:03:17,560
If Cheng and Luo Song

33
00:03:17,879 --> 00:03:19,680
really were responsible for Fu's death,

34
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,639
I'll arrest them myself.

35
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,520
If they really had something

36
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,280
to do with my brother's death,

37
00:03:31,879 --> 00:03:33,240
I'll kill them before you
get the chance.

38
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:49,240
Hey.

39
00:03:51,439 --> 00:03:52,400
Now that you're a cop again,

40
00:03:52,919 --> 00:03:53,800
are you any happier?

41
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,240
What about you?

42
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,800
Are you happy being the shot-caller?

43
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:25,399
What's this?

44
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:28,600
I found it on some punk

45
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:30,079
while I was out on patrol.

46
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:31,600
I heard that green-haired guy

47
00:04:31,900 --> 00:04:33,560
who died under the bridge a few days ago

48
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:34,630
also died

49
00:04:34,630 --> 00:04:36,120
from overdosing on this stuff.

50
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:44,480
All of Dongshan Tai's Yaba

51
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,879
should've been destroyed by now.

52
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,240
The Gang's leader?

53
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,040
How do you know so much?

54
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:53,480
I saw it on the news.

55
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,200
You've probably been too busy

56
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,600
to even watch the news.

57
00:04:59,639 --> 00:05:01,600
I have to turn all this evidence in
at Headquarters.

58
00:05:01,839 --> 00:05:03,680
It'll all be disposed of periodically.

59
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,079
Let me help you.

60
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,519
You've been

61
00:05:12,199 --> 00:05:12,920
working really hard lately.

62
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,240
Hello.

63
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,639
You could've come earlier

64
00:05:21,639 --> 00:05:22,879
or waited till later.

65
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:23,923
Why show up

66
00:05:23,924 --> 00:05:24,680
right at this time?

67
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,720
What if they are mine?

68
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,399
Bobo.

69
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,480
Come back for the receipt
this afternoon.

70
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,639
I can log this stuff pretty quickly.

71
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,279
Then go ahead and process it.

72
00:05:33,279 --> 00:05:33,800
Okay.

73
00:05:34,399 --> 00:05:36,680
There's a new movie out.

74
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:37,279
Do you want to go see it together?

75
00:05:38,319 --> 00:05:39,600
All that fighting and killing...

76
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,839
- What's so good about that?
- How about a horror movie?

77
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,160
A horror movie?

78
00:05:43,839 --> 00:05:44,600
Too scary.

79
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:45,560
(Case Closure Registration Log)

80
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:52,400
(Case Closure Report:
Dongshan Tai Drug Trafficking Case)

81
00:05:55,900 --> 00:05:57,160
(Case Closure Report:
Dongshan Tai Drug Trafficking Case)

82
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,840
(Dongshan Tai apprehended.
All Yaba destroyed.)

83
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:00,000
(Officer Recommends Case Closure
Signature: Luo Song)

84
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:02,839
What are you doing?

85
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,160
It's a little messy over here.

86
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,040
I was just tidying things up for you.

87
00:06:06,439 --> 00:06:08,120
This is evidence.
You can't just touch it.

88
00:06:12,319 --> 00:06:12,800
Bobo.

89
00:06:13,519 --> 00:06:14,879
I know a really good restaurant.

90
00:06:15,199 --> 00:06:16,120
Do you want to go with me?

91
00:06:16,439 --> 00:06:17,639
Sure. Sounds good.

92
00:06:22,399 --> 00:06:23,839
Bobo, there's a movie on Friday.

93
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:25,439
It's animated.
Do you want to go watch it, Bobo?

94
00:06:31,399 --> 00:06:33,240
W-We've been waiting for days.

95
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:35,720
Is this tip even reliable?

96
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,399
What's wrong with you now?

97
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:41,519
I-I went to see Tidao the other day.

98
00:06:41,879 --> 00:06:43,399
H-He looked

99
00:06:43,399 --> 00:06:45,800
like he'd lost a ton of weight.

100
00:06:46,879 --> 00:06:49,839
Boss Lin didn't have a choice.

101
00:06:50,439 --> 00:06:51,439
No choice?

102
00:06:52,079 --> 00:06:52,920
So what?

103
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:56,519
I-I'm still scared thinking about it.

104
00:06:57,399 --> 00:06:58,399
What if next time

105
00:06:59,279 --> 00:07:01,480
it's us?

106
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:10,439
I-Isn't that Luo Song?

107
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:12,972
This doesn't look like

108
00:07:12,973 --> 00:07:13,920
the kind of place he'd come to.

109
00:07:14,879 --> 00:07:15,680
Let's keep watching.

110
00:07:16,319 --> 00:07:17,319
Something's off.

111
00:07:24,839 --> 00:07:25,319
Hey.

112
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:47,399
W-Why

113
00:07:47,399 --> 00:07:49,160
hasn't he come out yet?

114
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,800
Here he is!

115
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,720
Move.

116
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,800
W-Why is there only one guy?

117
00:08:24,839 --> 00:08:26,199
There he is.

118
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,080
Let's go take a look.

119
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:34,360
Go.

120
00:08:50,919 --> 00:08:51,600
Think.

121
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,080
What else haven't you told us?

122
00:08:53,759 --> 00:08:56,039
Luo Song gave us the money
and the drugs.

123
00:08:57,159 --> 00:08:58,360
He told me to do it.

124
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,879
I've told you everything I know.

125
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,159
Wait!

126
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:11,279
This is it.

127
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,039
That's right.

128
00:09:13,919 --> 00:09:14,919
This is the place.

129
00:09:15,879 --> 00:09:16,559
That guy...

130
00:09:17,679 --> 00:09:19,080
they chopped him up

131
00:09:20,279 --> 00:09:21,120
and fed him to the pigs.

132
00:09:22,799 --> 00:09:23,600
I didn't kill anyone.

133
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:33,759
Who did those pigs eat?

134
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:37,279
Boss Cheng told us
to bring the guy here.

135
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,159
That day,

136
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:48,519
was this the guy?

137
00:09:49,919 --> 00:09:50,759
Yeah.

138
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,159
That's him.

139
00:10:11,039 --> 00:10:11,559
Sir.

140
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,919
Hutou Jun and Gui Sheng from Nanhu Gang

141
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,279
had just let Boss Hai go,

142
00:10:15,279 --> 00:10:16,559
so I grabbed him and brought him back.

143
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,399
Did anyone see you?

144
00:10:19,879 --> 00:10:20,559
Definitely not.

145
00:10:31,879 --> 00:10:32,320
Boss Hai.

146
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,039
Dongcheng Gang

147
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,360
won't let you get away with this.

148
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:36,799
Sorry.

149
00:10:37,519 --> 00:10:38,759
The Dongcheng Gang

150
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:41,559
may never even find your body.

151
00:10:52,639 --> 00:10:54,720
Let's send them a little gift first.

152
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:38,480
Someone's there!

153
00:11:38,919 --> 00:11:39,480
After him!

154
00:12:39,919 --> 00:12:41,360
Did you find any evidence?

155
00:12:45,159 --> 00:12:46,320
I didn't find anything.

156
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:48,240
I'll keep looking.

157
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,360
(Wasn't all of Dongshan Tai's Yaba)

158
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:03,679
(destroyed?)

159
00:13:04,519 --> 00:13:05,759
(Why has it resurfaced?)

160
00:13:07,518 --> 00:13:09,078
(All destroyed. So why has it
resurfaced?)

161
00:13:09,380 --> 00:13:11,540
(Was Fu connected to them?)

162
00:13:11,679 --> 00:13:12,679
(He's killing someone!)

163
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:14,039
(He's killing someone!)

164
00:13:14,039 --> 00:13:15,759
(Why was Fu so afraid of Luo Song?)

165
00:13:17,879 --> 00:13:19,080
(They'd never met before.)

166
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:22,320
(That day at the pool hall,)

167
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:24,759
(Luo Song wasn't in uniform.)

168
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,879
(The autopsy report said)

169
00:13:28,879 --> 00:13:31,039
(Boss Hai's fingers showed signs
of animal bites.)

170
00:13:32,071 --> 00:13:35,270
(What was Luo's role? Was he involved?
If Hai's death was connected to Luo...)

171
00:13:39,559 --> 00:13:41,080
(Did Fu see something?)

172
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,159
(If my brother's death)

173
00:13:44,399 --> 00:13:45,679
(really had something to do with them,)

174
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,600
(I'll kill them first.)

175
00:13:50,759 --> 00:13:51,240
(Lin)

176
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:53,000
(knows everything.)

177
00:13:55,560 --> 00:14:01,300
(What roles did Wang Cheng
and Luo Song play?)

178
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:16,519
Officer Luo.

179
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:22,080
If a close colleague of yours

180
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:22,759
made a mistake,

181
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:25,240
what would you do?

182
00:14:26,879 --> 00:14:28,320
(Everyone makes mistakes.)

183
00:14:29,159 --> 00:14:31,559
(It depends on whether the mistake
can be fixed.)

184
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:37,200
(What roles did Wang Cheng
and Luo Song play?)

185
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,279
(What's wrong, Che?)

186
00:14:39,879 --> 00:14:41,440
I'd like to talk to you in person.

187
00:14:58,960 --> 00:14:59,960
This is Luo Song.

188
00:15:00,159 --> 00:15:01,320
How've you been?

189
00:15:01,759 --> 00:15:02,559
You doing alright?

190
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,559
(Just tell me what you want.)

191
00:15:04,919 --> 00:15:05,720
Nothing.

192
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:08,480
I just wanted to see

193
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,679
how my junior officer's doing.

194
00:15:09,679 --> 00:15:11,240
He hasn't caused you any trouble,
has he?

195
00:15:11,559 --> 00:15:12,639
(He's a hard worker.)

196
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,440
(An officer trained by Officer Luo)

197
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,559
(could hardly be any trouble.)

198
00:15:16,519 --> 00:15:17,320
You're too kind.

199
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,600
Please look after him.

200
00:15:20,039 --> 00:15:22,799
What kind of work
has he been handling lately?

201
00:15:23,399 --> 00:15:24,519
(He's good with computers.)

202
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:26,639
(He handles all the filing himself.)

203
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:30,120
Take good care of him for me.

204
00:15:30,399 --> 00:15:32,279
I'll take you out for dinner sometime.

205
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:33,960
- (Sure.)
- I'll call you.

206
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:35,639
- Alright. Bye.
- (Bye.)
